        "id": 1569742
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-21T16:14:22Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "There are _some_ places where we take the read lock, e.g. when relaxing permissions in user_mem_abort() or pkvm_mem_abort_range(), and the readers shouldn\u0027t progress the seqcnt so I figured we might as well let them run?",
